The engine-generator sets and diesel fire pump (Ref. Nos. A/B10, A/B11, C12-C17, D1-D10, D18-D27, FP1, G8-G9, EG1-EG7, EGR, EGHS, and EGLS) shall only be operated in the following modes:

a. In situations that arises from sudden and reasonably unforeseeable events where the primary energy or power source is disrupted or disconnected due to conditions beyond the control of an owner or operator of a facility including:

i. A failure of the electrical grid;  

ii. On-site disaster or equipment failure; or 

iii. Public service emergencies such as flood, fire, natural disaster, or severe weather conditions.

